WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.071 --> 00:00:11.304
Pip claps. "I'm a prince!"

2
00:00:11.305 --> 00:00:19.675
"No," Jane says. "And I'm not a princess."

3
00:00:19.676 --> 00:00:24.547
"Yes, you are, Princess Jane," June says.

4
00:00:24.548 --> 00:00:27.683
"You must come with me."

5
00:00:27.684 --> 00:00:33.489
Jane blinks. "What?"

6
00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:37.795
"I will explain," June says.

7
00:00:37.796 --> 00:00:42.539
"Sweet Land has a candy train."

8
00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:48.225
Pip licks his lips. "Yum!"

9
00:00:48.226 --> 00:00:53.803
"The Duke of Yuck hates candy," June says.

10
00:00:53.804 --> 00:01:00.564
"One day he broke the rails.

11
00:01:00.565 --> 00:01:08.743
Then he stole the candy from the train."

12
00:01:08.744 --> 00:01:12.687
Pip gasps as June goes on.

13
00:01:12.688 --> 00:01:15.982
"So the queen put him in jail."

14
00:01:15.983 --> 00:01:19.012
"Yay!" Pip says.

15
00:01:19.013 --> 00:01:24.244
"But the duke got away!" June says.

16
00:01:24.245 --> 00:01:27.461
"He just broke out of jail.

17
00:01:27.462 --> 00:01:31.433
You can help us stop his plan."

18
00:01:31.434 --> 00:01:35.800
"We can't stay here," Pip says.

19
00:01:35.801 --> 00:01:38.007
"We have to help!"

20
00:01:38.008 --> 00:01:42.299
"It's just a game, Pip," Jane says.

21
00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:45.645
"It may be a game," Pip says.

22
00:01:45.646 --> 00:01:48.954
"But I still want to play!"

23
00:01:48.955 --> 00:01:53.594
Pip grabs Jane's hand.

24
00:01:53.595 --> 00:01:56.538
June raises her wand.

25
00:01:56.539 --> 00:02:00.928
"I will take you all the way there."

26
00:02:00.929 --> 00:02:04.116
But Jane steps back.

27
00:02:04.117 --> 00:02:09.937
"Wait! I still think this is fake."

